sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as Send API / hogflow
    participant DB as cyclotron_jobs
    participant Bulk as Bulk loop (pod)
    participant Fast as Fast lane (same pod) Q1 A
    participant Bucket as SES bucket
    participant Send as executeSendEmail
    Bulk->>DB: count, claim, dequeue up to batchMaxSize (priority first)
    Bulk->>Send: processBatch(bulk rows), awaits the slowest row
    Note over Bulk: batch in flight, the bulk loop does not poll
    API->>DB: insert priority 0 row
    loop every fast poll delay while a batch is in flight
        Fast->>DB: countWork(priority = 0, small limit)
    end
    Fast->>Bucket: claimBatchLimit(visible) Q2
    Fast->>DB: fairDequeue(priority = 0, small limit), SKIP LOCKED
    Fast->>Send: processBatch(fast rows), same event loop
    Send-->>API: SES handoff without waiting for the bulk batch
    Bulk->>DB: next poll, also takes priority 0 rows first
